    {
      "id": "Q1_full",
      "task": 1,
      "mode": "完整问题",
      "query": "建设单位需要配备什么质量管理人员、谁留存检查记录？",
      "decision": "answer",
      "top5": [
        {
          "rank": 1,
          "article_id": "rail_quality:art-8",
          "article_no": "第八条",
          "doc_id": "rail_quality",
          "version_id": "amended_2021_12_23",
          "text": "第八条 建设单位应设立质量管理机构，制定质量管理制度，配备专职质量管理人员，落实质量责任，建立健全项目质量管理体系。\n建设单位应在建设项目指导性施工组织设计中载明项目质量目标和工程质量管理措施，对工程质量进行监督检查并制作、留存检查记录。",
          "chars": 119,
          "full_chars": 119,
          "truncated": false,
          "source_url": "https://xxgk.mot.gov.cn/2020/jigou/fgs/202202/t20220225_3643089.html",
          "source_sha256": "c5301ee800e41d263a11b985b4a7aa226aa44e47d827258290cef630d0c94741",
          "locator_relative": "../locators/rail_quality.locator.html#art-8",
          "pdf_page": 2,
          "pdf_relative": "../work/raw/A_spec.pdf#page=2"
        },
        {
          "rank": 2,
          "article_id": "construction_quality:art-50",
          "article_no": "第五十条",
          "doc_id": "construction_quality",
          "version_id": "revised_2019_04_23",
          "text": "第五十条 有关单位和个人对县级以上人民政府建设行政主管部门和其他有关部门进行的监督检查应当支持与配合，不得拒绝或者阻碍建设工程质量监督检查人员依法执行职务。",
          "chars": 78,
          "full_chars": 78,
          "truncated": false,
          "source_url": "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/bgt/art/2023/art_e42ecef60e9146af83cf9846821fac6c.html",
          "source_sha256": "b99ba02820806b3a0ffd4b78573b1dfc8a5745ffd77d3e84c80d12abe6533ee3",
          "locator_relative": "../locators/construction_quality.locator.html#art-50",
          "pdf_page": 12,
          "pdf_relative": "../work/raw/B_copy_cas.pdf#page=12"
        },
        {
          "rank": 3,
          "article_id": "construction_quality:art-48",
          "article_no": "第四十八条",
          "doc_id": "construction_quality",
          "version_id": "revised_2019_04_23",
          "text": "第四十八条 县级以上人民政府建设行政主管部门和其他有关部门履行监督检查职责时，有权采取下列措施：\n(一)要求被检查的单位提供有关工程质量的文件和资料；\n(二)进入被检查单位的施工现场进行检查；\n(三)发现有影响工程质量的问题时，责令改正。",
          "chars": 119,
          "full_chars": 119,
          "truncated": false,
          "source_url": "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/bgt/art/2023/art_e42ecef60e9146af83cf9846821fac6c.html",
          "source_sha256": "d7706f601cdabe0cb8b7ca5cebcf650e347ad5e6d79e9a2312683e598eabc54a",
          "locator_relative": "../locators/construction_quality.locator.html#art-48",
          "pdf_page": 11,
          "pdf_relative": "../work/raw/B_copy_cas.pdf#page=11"
        },
        {
          "rank": 4,
          "article_id": "construction_quality:art-29",
          "article_no": "第二十九条",
          "doc_id": "construction_quality",
          "version_id": "revised_2019_04_23",
          "text": "第二十九条 施工单位必须按照工程设计要求、施工技术标准和合同约定，对建筑材料、建筑构配件、设备和商品混凝土进行检验，检验应当有书面记录和专人签字；未经检验或者检验不合格的，不得使用。",
          "chars": 91,
          "full_chars": 91,
          "truncated": false,
          "source_url": "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/bgt/art/2023/art_e42ecef60e9146af83cf9846821fac6c.html",
          "source_sha256": "f8a1492b14b374e30a15f61a75250ba01b99c09e16ca86795fc635d229b87d79",
          "locator_relative": "../locators/construction_quality.locator.html#art-29",
          "pdf_page": 7,
          "pdf_relative": "../work/raw/B_copy_cas.pdf#page=7"
        },
        {
          "rank": 5,
          "article_id": "construction_quality:art-30",
          "article_no": "第三十条",
          "doc_id": "construction_quality",
          "version_id": "revised_2019_04_23",
          "text": "第三十条 施工单位必须建立、健全施工质量的检验制度，严格工序管理，作好隐蔽工程的质量检查和记录。隐蔽工程在隐蔽前，施工单位应当通知建设单位和建设工程质量监督机构。",
          "chars": 81,
          "full_chars": 81,
          "truncated": false,
          "source_url": "https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/bgt/art/2023/art_e42ecef60e9146af83cf9846821fac6c.html",
          "source_sha256": "7c03acb6c9e96e15f5e65e9fa0eac2b5c7b2173948c970e684c1fb802b147d12",
          "locator_relative": "../locators/construction_quality.locator.html#art-30",
          "pdf_page": 7,
          "pdf_relative": "../work/raw/B_copy_cas.pdf#page=7"
        }
      ],
      "diagnostics": {
